              "text": "southeastern United States.",
              "pdf_page": 727,
              "printed_page": 645,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "United States thanHepatozoon americanum; it"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Cats—uncommon in the United States.",
              "pdf_page": 727,
